Valuation uses the journal’s USD default instead of assuming SEK.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['Assets:'], inValuationCommodity: true })

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
P 2024-01-01 FUND 12 USD
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {12 USD}
  Equity:Opening  -24 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Fund",
    "commodity": "USD",
    "quantity": "24"
  }
]
